abstract: >
  A comprehensive film database for the ex-Yugoslav region,
  featuring movies, actors, directors, and collaborative
  relationships from Serbia, Croatia, Bosnia and Herzegovina,
  Montenegro, North Macedonia, Slovenia, and Kosovo. Built
  with Next.js 16, TypeScript, and SQLite, integrating data
  from TMDb API and Wikidata.
